#: ../../source/docs/common-DroneerF405.rst:53
#: 3e431fbbce514ff793f36d04c7554913 b1a986e693c24fd7b0adf37983482124
#: b30a47d8e119469892145bf43924bf49 c3ef44de1518490687f6017848d5d9ff
#: dc4c8d3ba47d44c18ff6969e5c4bf4ae
msgid ""
"The SBUS pin (SBU), is passed by an inverter to RX2 (UART2 RX), which can be"
" used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except PPM, CRSF/ELRS,"
" and SRXL2. CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 require the RX2 and TX2s pin be connected "
"instead of the SBUS pin."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 引脚（SBU）经反相器接到 RX2（UART2 RX），可用于 ArduPilot 支持的所有接收机协议，但 PPM、CRSF/ELRS 和 "
"SRXL2 除外。CRSF/ELRS 与 SRXL2 需改接 RX2 和 TX2 引脚，而不是 SBUS 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-DroneerF405.rst:55
#: 0e66ed91c6724540ba151010f41b4c44 2b0a108c1c584e88a867102b1fcdb612
#: 72c1b5ceae7b4c52a26df6142fb5949e 80fcc196b913460fafd165401cfbc3da
#: 9002a09c27b94800922333dcf0100f8d
msgid "SRXL2 requires :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to “4”."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为 “4”。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-DroneerF405.rst:56
#: 5ad09a982d584344a5e4c50feeb908ba 5ee3f6583e994d80beee6d1d61fbde7a
#: a309f63f8d1a4c1bada8f9bc54074a19 d64a1c1eb500481bb10cb9baa5b9fc64
#: f7fadbf91cd0410d82805998f67b2ce6
msgid ""
"Fport should be connected to TX2 via a bi-directional inverter and "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to “4”. See :ref:`common-"
"connecting-sport-fport`."
msgstr ""
"FPort 应经双向反相器连接到 TX2，并将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为 “4”。参见 "
":ref:`common-connecting-sport-fport`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-DroneerF405.rst:58
#: 68e24a709d624d4dad3df24badeb9964 6f39b27d5b0e4169abb65988a04dd28f
#: aab1fb5a47b741d8961017941f76e586 d0ef46f04cbd4e44bd188f30b507756e
#: f3a9333d84864dd282582846c217b3bf
msgid ""
"Any UART can also be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion "
"on other UARTs). See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中任意 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议（在其他 UART 上使用 SBUS 需要外部反相）。详见 "
":ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-DroneerF405.rst:61
#: 631a0929cf474f8f8f57d1202c045845 6e28257fda154f419c2a2f3621a976e1
