#: 70bc24fa9f2c4987a733e3b906e5a7d1 ee5905d3cf154d53bf157409ce7e90e0
#: ef147ed5beda465da101cfa8e7b5e211
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-DroneerF405.rst:70
#: 307c75c7ba3d4e70ab5072ecac04d14c 5d61c8b0bea348d6b2968970454b8a75
#: 9a688ba885374c3f8f9ed952f1205306 cd3836f0ebf1495ea169069208bb336b
#: f6aab37cf693478b96fcf46a4f690092
msgid ""
"The Droneer F405 supports analog OSD using its integrated MAX7456. "
"Simultaneous HD TVX OSD operation can also be obtained using an available "
"UART whose protocol is set to \"DisplayPort (42)\" and "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` set to \"5\"."
msgstr ""
"Droneer F405 通过集成的 MAX7456 支持模拟 OSD。也可同时使用高清图传 OSD：将任一可用 UART 的协议设为 "
"\"DisplayPort (42)\"，并把 :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` 设为 \"5\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-DroneerF405.rst:72
#: 06f067e61a904e8f8e05be698dc6d5dc 6a113f2bcb9e4e7089769126558e01d2
#: 756a16b8ab184ae4846f62b6696c1062 c4daa0f539124fdaadcc7a066c7827fa
#: e95560dd3b104522be00096bcef0e82f
msgid ""
"The JST-GH-4P connector supports a standard \"Tramp\" VTX connection. Pin 1 "
"of the connector is 10v so be careful not to connect this to a peripheral "
"requiring 5v."
msgstr "JST-GH-4P 连接器支持标准 \"Tramp\" 图传连接。该连接器的 1 号引脚为 10V，切勿将其接到需要 5V 的外设上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-DroneerF405.rst:75
#: 360a4f2c58ce4573a89e7e2f993197d0 3f47367183e143d793d9846222617cb8
