#: ../../source/docs/common-DroneerF405.rst:76
#: 22e8f4c894d5460e95fd957cc2ed018e a36c49597e114948ac419bf3b61e990b
#: d9221d5608134c43a324d4f21cc4cccb dcf06d8c3ec442e194ac167c060fbf7d
#: fc69e04caf564fa48c86c08ac506e806
msgid ""
"The Droneer F405 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The ESC connectors have M1-8 "
"outputs, plus M9(marked LED) for LED strip or another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"Droneer F405 最多支持 9 路 PWM 输出。电调连接器提供 M1-8 输出，另有 M9（标记为 LED）可用于 LED 灯带或作为另一路 "
"PWM 输出。"

